  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Weather sphere (one (shroud) talent), caster level 10th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use a shroud as a standard or full-round action, you may spend a spell point to use a different shroud on the same target as a swift action. If the first shroud affected multiple targets (as with Encompassing Shroud), the second affects any one of the targets and may not be combined with Encompassing Shroud.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/weather#toc104\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
